== Overview ==
'''Phantom Toilet''' only appears in [[Abysmal Mode]] and [[Endless Mode]], is the only enemy with a dash mechanic and the only enemy that is translucent.

Its dash mechanic is very unique; while Phantom Toilet advances in the lane, every certain second '''Phantom Toilet''' will dash, making him advance 3 seconds of normal walking almost instantly, leaving a triangular white trail while doing this.

