== Strategy ==
You need to be ready the wave when Phantom Toilet appears, Phantom Toilet is not fast, but his dash mechanic will make him reach your units faster than other toilets.

His dash mechanic is extremely strong, and will make that your units attack him for less time. This is really problematic for short ranged and medium ranged units that will have less time to do damage to him.

Technically, the dash mechanic brings the same difficulties that the [[UFO Toilet]] invisibility does. Only difference is that your units won't be attacking an invisible invincible enemy for some seconds and losing DPS, so if you know how to deal with UFO Toilet, you should be able to adapt to this as well.

